    - "theorem dependency edges and computational certificate registrations when applicable"
    - "docs/state/artifact-index.jsonl and per-artifact theorem-state headers"
    - "docs/state/STATUS.generated.md and docs/state/THEOREM_GRAPH.generated.md"
